---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 24
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: How the upgrade test runs
    accDescr: The upgrade test installs the signed package of the last release, which occ integrity:check-app must find intact while a copy with one changed file fails, and uses it as an administrator does, with the token, per-user ownership, the webhook, the copies of two owners, an import, a retry and a file to send. It records every row, setting, credential, migration and file ID. Then the package of the commit, which krankerl builds as the release does, replaces the release, and occ upgrade runs every new migration on those rows. A migration that fails turns the test red, as it would leave every server in maintenance mode. Otherwise everything recorded must be unchanged, and the next run must work with the stored token, download nothing, keep waiting with the retry and finish the import of the release.

    release["The last release,<br>signed as in<br>the App Store"]
    intact{"occ integrity:<br>check-app"}
    use["In use: token,<br>per-user owners,<br>webhook, copies,<br>import, retry,<br>file to send"]
    before["Recorded: rows,<br>settings,<br>credentials,<br>migrations,<br>file IDs"]
    commit["The package of<br>the commit,<br>by krankerl"]
    upgrade{"occ upgrade:<br>every migration<br>meets the rows"}
    after["Unchanged; the<br>next run fetches<br>nothing, keeps<br>the retry, ends<br>the import"]
    failed["Failed: servers<br>would stay in<br>maintenance mode"]

    release --> intact
    intact -- "intact; a changed<br>copy fails" --> use
    use --> before
    before --> commit
    commit --> upgrade
    upgrade -- "passed" --> after
    upgrade -- "a migration fails" --> failed

    classDef paperless fill:#17803d2e,stroke:#17803d,stroke-width:2px
    classDef check fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef data fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef refused fill:#c9302c1f,stroke:#c9302c,stroke-width:2px
    class release,commit paperless
    class intact,upgrade check
    class use,before data
    class after done
    class failed refused
